Chapter 7: Components Description
ESP32

ESP32 is a 32-bit microcontroller with built-in Wi-Fi and Bluetooth. It acts as the brain of the system.

MQ2 Gas Sensor

Detects combustible gases including LPG, methane, smoke, propane, hydrogen, and alcohol vapors.

LEDs

Green LED indicates safe operation.

Yellow LED indicates warning level.

Red LED indicates dangerous gas concentration.

Active Buzzer

Produces an audible alarm when dangerous gas levels are detected.

Blynk IoT

Provides remote monitoring and real-time notifications.

