Chapter 10: Working Principle
ESP32 connects to Wi-Fi.
MQ2 sensor measures gas concentration.
ESP32 reads analog values.
Values are compared with warning and danger thresholds.
LEDs indicate the current safety status.
Buzzer activates during dangerous gas leakage.
Sensor readings are uploaded to Blynk.
