Chapter 17: Conclusion

The Smart Gas Leakage Detection and Alert System using ESP32 and Blynk IoT is a practical and cost-effective solution for detecting combustible gas leakage. By combining sensor technology with IoT, the system enhances safety through local alarms and remote monitoring. It is suitable for residential, commercial, and industrial environments and can be further improved with cloud services and automated safety mechanisms.

